## 3. 数据模型草案（建议 Prisma / Postgres，或先 SQLite）

### 3.1 Session
Session {
  id: string (session_id)
  title: string
  mode: "argument" | "observation"
  phase: string            // e.g. "0" "1.5" "4" "4.5" ...
  substate: "idle" | "await_confirm" | "await_select" | "await_free_text"
  pending_input: null | "brief_fields" | "revision_choice" | "publish_channel"
  state_json: json         // 存 Skill state（facts/thesis/evidence map 等）
  created_at: number
  updated_at: number
}

### 3.2 Artifact
Artifact {
  id: string (artifact_id)
  session_id: string
  kind: string    // "brief_card" | "outline" | "draft_v3" | "review_report_v3" | "publish_record" ...
  version: number | null   // 对 draft/review 建议抽出 version 字段，kind 仍保留 draft_vN 也可
  title: string | null
  content: string          // Markdown 为主（先跑通）
  meta_json: json          // 例如：来源素材、评分、风险等
  source_job_id: string | null
  created_at: number
}

### 3.3 Job
Job {
  id: string (job_id)
  session_id: string
  phase: string
  task: string             // generate_outline|generate_draft|review|rewrite_paragraph|publish_dry_run...
  status: "queued"|"running"|"paused"|"failed"|"completed"|"committed"
  inputs_json: json
  next_offset: number
  is_final: boolean
  error_json: json | null
  created_at: number
  updated_at: number
}

### 3.4 Chunk
Chunk {
  job_id: string
  offset: number           // 单调递增
  kind: "text"|"meta"
  delta: string
  ts: number
}

索引建议：
- Chunk(job_id, offset) unique
- Artifact(session_id, kind, created_at)
- Job(session_id, created_at)

