## 4. 协议：API 请求/响应（草案）

### 4.1 POST /api/jobs  创建任务
Request:
{
  "session_id": "s_123",
  "phase": "4",
  "task": "generate_draft",
  "inputs": {
    "brief_artifact_id": "a_brief_1",
    "outline_artifact_id": "a_outline_2",
    "style_preset": "default"
  }
}
Response:
{
  "job": {
    "job_id": "j_789",
    "session_id": "s_123",
    "phase": "4",
    "task": "generate_draft",
    "status": "queued",
    "next_offset": 0,
    "is_final": false,
    "created_at": 173..., "updated_at": 173...
  }
}

### 4.2 GET /api/jobs/:jobId/chunks?after=offset  拉取分片
Response:
{
  "job": {
    "job_id": "j_789",
    "status": "running",
    "next_offset": 12,
    "is_final": false,
    "updated_at": 173...
  },
  "chunks": [
    { "offset": 10, "kind": "text", "delta": "段落1...\\n\\n", "ts": 173... },
    { "offset": 11, "kind": "text", "delta": "段落2...\\n\\n", "ts": 173... }
  ]
}

规则：
- 客户端保存 next_offset，下次 after=next_offset
- chunks 可为空；若连续多次为空则客户端退避轮询间隔
- is_final=true 表示不会再有新 chunks

### 4.3 POST /api/jobs/:jobId/commit  入库为 artifact
Request:
{
  "artifact_kind": "draft_v3",
  "title": "（可选）",
  "mode": "new_version"     // always new_version for draft/review
}
Response:
{
  "artifact": { ...Artifact },
  "job": { "job_id":"j_789", "status":"committed", "is_final": true, "next_offset": 12 }
}

### 4.4 Session 状态（substate/pending_input）
GET /api/sessions/:sessionId 返回：
{
  "session": {
    "session_id":"s_123",
    "phase":"1.5",
    "substate":"await_select",
    "pending_input": null,
    "state_json": {...}
  },
  "next_actions": [
    { "id":"act_pick_angle", "label":"选择切入点", "primary": true },
    { "id":"act_edit_brief", "label":"修改 Brief", "primary": false }
  ]
}

说明：
- next_actions 服务端给 1-2 个即可（符合契约）
- 小程序底部输入区根据 substate/pending_input 渲染控件：
  - await_confirm -> Yes/Modify/Redo
  - await_select  -> 选项按钮组
  - await_free_text -> 输入框 + 示例 chips
  - pending_input=publish_channel -> 发布渠道 sheet/preset

